# The play · Scene 6, the next morning. Tomas is early, for once. Yuki brings a book and a word she does not know, and each of them answers her in their own way: a feeling gets a reaction, a why gets a because, a sorry is waved away, a thanks is nothing.
## (scene sixth/ADJ the)

(be dry (SUBJ (market the)))                                                 # The market is dry.
(come early/ADV (SUBJ "Tomas"))                                              # Tomas comes early.
